[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571780624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101163#issuecomment-2571780624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101163","id":2571780624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSkIQ","user":{"login":"yankscally","id":27631913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjMxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27631913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally","html_url":"https://github.com/yankscally","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T23:02:15Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T23:02:15Z","body":"so cool! wowee! love me some QoL","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571780624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2574135473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101163#issuecomment-2574135473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101163","id":2574135473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZbjCx","user":{"login":"badsectoracula","id":20316467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzE2NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20316467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula","html_url":"https://github.com/badsectoracula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T23:57:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T23:59:54Z","body":"I tried this and it works as described. The code looks ok too.\r\n\r\nThere are two things that i noticed:\r\n\r\n1. Trying to rename something to '%Foo' when there is another unique 'Foo' elsewhere gives some internal warning. Perhaps it could give an error message or produce a new name like if you try to rename something to 'Foo' when there is already an existing 'Foo' (in which case the node is renamed to 'Foo2'). Note that this already happens if you try to rename something to '%Foo' with an existing 'Foo' under the same parent.\r\n2. I expected that if you try to rename an already unique node, the editable field would add the '%' so you can either remove it, thus making the node non-unique. *Technically* the PR is about making a node unique, not the reverse, it just feels a bit inconsistent :-P. Also it'd help with just pressing F2 and then Ctrl+C to copy the unique name for use in scripts.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2574135473/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575359169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101163#issuecomment-2575359169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101163","id":2575359169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZgNzB","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T13:58:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T13:58:16Z","body":"> Trying to rename something to '%Foo' when there is another unique 'Foo' elsewhere gives some internal warning.\r\n\r\nThe worse part is that this discards your name. Showing warning is probably fine, but the node should still be renamed, just without unique name.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575359169/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576474227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101163#issuecomment-2576474227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101163","id":2576474227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZkeBz","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T00:26:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T00:26:50Z","body":"Thanks for the suggestions, @badsectoracula and @KoBeWi!\r\n\r\n1. I was going with the original implementation for if there was already a unique name, but I do agree it makes more sense to keep the name if not make it a unique name. I also think renaming the node to \"Foo2\" makes sense, to ease the workflow further. Since the user would now be able to set a unique name just by renaming the node, it would be the most intuitive and consistent solution here as well. But perhaps someone else can give their opinion about this?\r\n2. This is pretty similar to @Mickeon's suggestions in godotengine/godot-proposals#4494, which I took a look at. I'm not sure if that would be out of scope for this PR, since it just adds a new feature, not changing any visual appearance. But it can always be implemented in a new PR if we want. For the keyboard shortcut, I was thinking while renaming it, the user could Ctrl/Cmd+A Ctrl/Cmd+C (selecting the entire field and copying) it before confirming so that it can be pasted into code. But I suppose if you want to copy with the \"%\" even after renaming it, this makes sense.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576474227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2579160549","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101163#issuecomment-2579160549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101163","id":2579160549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zut3l","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T04:31:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T04:35:29Z","body":"It looks like renaming to \"Foo2\" would either need some changes in [scene/main/node.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/main/node.cpp) since it currently only supports renumbering of child nodes, or duplicating the similar logic to the function, which would make it very complex. So that is probably out-of-scope for this PR. But perhaps it can be implemented in a future PR. For now, I will use @KoBeWi's suggestion.\r\n\r\nAlso fixed a bug where adding \"%\" without changing the rest of the name while there is already a unique node with the same name does not show a warning.\r\n\r\nEdit: Also rebased from master. That's why the comparison between force-pushes way more complex than it should.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2579160549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2580006087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101163#issuecomment-2580006087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101163","id":2580006087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zx8TH","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti